'''10th Anniv. Cake Doge''' is a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemy that appears in [[Anniversary|B-Day Gifts]]. It was added in [[Version 11.10 Update|Version 11.10]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = 10th Anniv. Cake Doge
|image = E 625.png
|appearance = [[10 Years of Fun!]]
|money drop = 7¢ - 27¢
}}

==Enemy==
The [[Doge]]s are here to bring the Cat's birthday gift! Despite its delectable appearence, it is actually a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemy. Its stats are pitiful, and even as a Metal enemy its health won't let it last long.

==Strategy==
[[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] and any other fast attacking characters such as [[Mr. (Special Cat)|Mr.]] can kill this enemy very easily. It deals pretty much no damage per hit, so there's no need to worry about it at all.

